# Fall of the Hawk (WotG 36): the login in Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] plays the zone-in 4, left open; its finish completes
# the mission (Darkness Descends current).
lists CastleZvahlBaileysS/onZoneIn/1 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/4
char zone=CastleZvahlBaileysS pos=179.4,-24.1,98 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg FallOfTheHawk current
login open                                 # 4
finish                                     # completed
